ing bracketed source\ncitations and cite at least ten distinct exact source IDs. Reconcile authority,\nhazard thresholds, power, water, clinical surge, cooling-center capacity,\naccessible transit, public communication, logistics, staffing, candidate\nlineage, and independent readiness.\n\nBind each action and gate to owners, prerequisites, observations, the current\ncandidate, falsifiers, rollback, and evidence that retires temporary controls.\nPreserve observations versus gates, probability versus coverage, installed\nversus usable capacity, reserve versus flow, median versus percentile, hours\nversus days, source-local authority, and current versus stale evidence.\n\nChecks are candidate-bound mechanical feedback. They do not independently\nauthorize operations, readiness, submission, or closure.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n# Trellis construction action contract\n\nReturn exactly one JSON action object and no prose.\n\n```text\n{\"action\":\"read_source\",\"source_id\":\"COUNCIL\",\"start_line\":1,\"end_line\":60}\n{\"action\":\"read_batch\",\"requests\":[{\"source_id\":\"COUNCIL\",\"start_line\":1,\"end_line\":60},{\"source_id\":\"CLIMATE\",\"start_line\":1,\"end_line\":60}]}\n{\"action\":\"reopen_exact\",\"result_id\":\"RESULT-001\"}\n{\"action\":\"replace_evidence_ledger\",\"content\":\"complete compact task-native evidence-to-requirement matrix\"}\n{\"action\":\"upsert_decision_section\",\"heading\":\"Authority, scope, and operating states\",\"body\":\"exact section body\"}\n{\"action\":\"patch_decision\",\"edits\":[{\"old\":\"exact unique text\",\"new\":\"replacement text\"}]}\n{\"action\":\"replace_decision\",\"content\":\"complete exact decision\"}\n{\"action\":\"begin_verification\"}\n```\n\nOne read may contain at most 120 lines. A batch may contain one or two ranges,\nat most 160 lines and 12,000 exact source bytes. Incremental ledger and section\nwork is exact, versioned task state and remains available after source bodies\nleave residency. `begin_verification` is valid only after the frozen mechanical\nconstruction milestone. It changes lifecycle phase, not candidate bytes, and\ndoes not assert readiness.\n\n\n# Common pre-fork action notice\nNo semantic-maintenance output is present during pressure screening. Both future configurations share this ordinary action surface and exact task work.\n\n# Exact source catalog\n{\"schema\":\"architecture-source-catalog-v0\",\"sources\":[{\"line_count\":94,\"sha256\":\"1dcfd09e66f004f0cf3b7849dcc7ca097d4d6135809649c33d6cb1784dac88ea\",\"size_bytes\":5794,\"source_id\":\"COUNCIL\",\"title\":\"Heat emergency authority and public operating states\"},{\"line_count\":94,\"sha256\":\"163e45cdae8f3d164079e68b4f2a1386df81616b32290eb79e51bd2ccde99ca7\",\"size_bytes\":6017,\"source_id\":\"CLIMATE\",\"title\":\"Heat index, WBGT, and geographic trigger evidence\"},{\"line_count\":94,\"sha256\":\"2149dcb753ebd817f10869d394e30f61e89ac46d6d4de2ace9bde1cb7c13299d\",\"size_bytes\":5546,\"source_id\":\"GRID\",\"title\":\"Cooling power, feeder limits, and backup capacity\"},{\"line_count\":94,\"sha256\":\"99ff010ef7c523ff6805b118fb7678a403caf6cfb047f9a7607832a51f1e4291\",\"size_bytes\":5054,\"source_id\":\"WATER\",\"title\":\"Potable water, pressure, and hydration logistics\"},{\"line_count\":94,\"sha256\":\"f8db85fe7f667c38151156fa2c5c25f3601462976e555f637ccff746c13a34b4\",\"size_bytes\":5990,\"source_id\":\"CLINIC\",\"title\":\"Clinical surge, triage, and ambulance readiness\"},{\"line_count\":94,\"sha256\":\"dcd71253d29841bf14beafb1e65b01527aa9c8dab2d65d352537ea6faec725fb\",\"size_bytes\":5949,\"source_id\":\"SHELTER\",\"title\":\"Cooling-center capacity, accessibility, and intake\"},{\"line_count\":94,\"sha256\":\"ffbd14f8f91fe0401dc7bd803384dc9fd57fc83e8cf827b06ca4820586cbbd1d\",\"size_bytes\":6022,\"source_id\":\"TRANSIT\",\"title\":\"Transit access, vehicle readiness, and route continuity\"},{\"line_count\":94,\"sha256\":\"eb7a710e40fa9c55f274159b16d44b15b18b566dadfbc0336b1f72a087244